# One line-ending policy for the whole repository: LF in the index and on checkout.
# Git normalizes on add, editors follow .editorconfig, and whole-file CRLF/LF churn
# is gone. `core.autocrlf` stays false; `text=auto` makes the policy explicit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files stay CRLF (cmd.exe label/goto edge cases).
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
